@startuml
actor User
participant "Frontend\n(Angular)" as Frontend
participant "FileUploadController\n(Spring Boot)" as Controller
participant "WorkLogService" as Service
database "PostgreSQL DB" as DB

User -> Frontend: Select file and click Upload
Frontend -> Controller: POST /api/upload (file)
Controller -> Service: processFile(file)
Service -> DB: Persist WorkLogEntry(s)
Service --> Controller: Return summary
Controller --> Frontend: Response (success/failure)
@enduml
